  "interpretation_boundaries": [
    "The primary causal contrast is the contemporaneous paired target-preannounced versus length-matched-null comparison in this database.",
    "The length-matched null is exactly surface matched but is an imperative irrelevant-formatting instruction, so it is treated as a competing-binding control rather than an inert placebo.",
    "A target-versus-null difference can contain a target benefit, a competing-null cost, or both.",
    "The frozen prior target rerun and prior uncued to current null comparisons are descriptive across execution order and time; the latter also changes cue semantics and has no causal interpretation.",
    "Literal typed-value exactness and quote grounding are separate outcomes and can move independently.",
    "Object-level answer and active-conclusion reconstruction can improve while source-level support calibration regresses.",
    "Exact upstream typed values localize a failure after extraction but do not identify a single downstream mechanism and are post-treatment conditional diagnostics.",
    "Two repetitions over sixteen fixed worlds expose case-conditioned trajectory stability but do not estimate broad provider performance.",
    "This output-only surface does not establish a complete pre-expression latent state or a dominant language bottleneck for general intelligence.",
    "A contemporaneous null-semantics ladder, crossed providers, hidden-state probes, and local training are separate future experiments and are not retroactively added to this run."
  ]
